---
// About.astro - Section showcasing Bryan's profile, background as Ingeniero en Sistemas & FullStack Developer
---

<section id="sobre-mi" class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono-code font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
        &lt;Sobre Mí /&gt;
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Ingeniería, Código y <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Visión de Producto</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Conoce más sobre mi trayectoria, formación y cómo combino la disciplina de la ingeniería con el desarrollo Full Stack moderno.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left: Photo & Highlight Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="relative group">
          <!-- Ambient Glow -->
          <div class="absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/30 to-indigo-500/30 rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-500"></div>
          
          <!-- Image Card -->
          <div class="relative w-64 h-64 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/10 shadow-2xl bg-slate-900">
            <img
              src="/img/foto_personal.jpg"
              alt="Bryan Martinez - Ingeniero en Sistemas y FullStack Developer"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4">
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Bryan Martinez</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-cyan-400 font-mono-code">Ing. en Sistemas · FullStack Dev</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating Badge -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 glass-panel px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🚀</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Experiencia</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-white">+3 Años Desarrollando</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Attributes -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 w-full max-w-xs">
          <div class="glass-panel p-3 rounded-xl text-center border border-white/5">
            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400">100%</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Compromiso & Calidad</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-3 rounded-xl text-center border border-white/5">
            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">4+</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Proyectos Clave</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Detailed Story & Core Principles -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            ¡Hola! Soy <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Bryan Martinez</strong>, <strong class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold">Ingeniero en Sistemas</strong> y <strong class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">Desarrollador Full Stack</strong>. Cuento con una base analítica rigurosa complementada con experiencia práctica en la creación de aplicaciones web escalables, intuitivas y de alto rendimiento.
          </p>
          <p>
            Mi objetivo primordial es transformar requerimientos de negocio en soluciones de software sólidas. En el <strong class="text-white">Frontend</strong> desarrollo interfaces reactivas y atractivas utilizando <span class="text-cyan-400">React, Astro, Tailwind CSS y JavaScript/TypeScript</span>. En el <strong class="text-white">Backend</strong> implemento arquitecturas robustas y APIs RESTful con <span class="text-indigo-400">Node.js, Express y Laravel</span>, conectadas a bases de datos relacionales y NoSQL como <span class="text-emerald-400">PostgreSQL, MongoDB y MySQL</span>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Strengths Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
          
          <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Frontend Reactivo</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Interfaces modernas, accesibles, rápidas y adaptadas a cualquier dispositivo.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-colors group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Backend & APIs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Servicios escalables, autenticación segura y modelos de datos eficientes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Clean Architecture</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Buenas prácticas de ingeniería, código modular y alta mantenibilidad.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Action Row -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/cv/CV_Bryan_Martinez.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600/60 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Ver Currículum Vitae</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="#contacto"
            class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1"
          >
            ¿Hablamos sobre una oportunidad? →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
